	text: [
		"Item Pipes are an easy way of moving items from one location to another. ",
		"",
		"To move items, place an extractor at the container you want to pull from, and then pipes all the way to where you want your items to go to.",
		"",
		"Place a lever on the extractor and activate it to start moving items. ",
		"",
		"You can't directly connect 2 containers with just an extractor, it always needs at least 1 pipe as well."
